Hello,

I hope you are doing well.

We are a family in Ridgewood, New Jersey, looking for a reliable, long-term
caregiver to support our family.

We have a 6-year-old son who will be entering first grade, and we are
seeking someone who is experienced with school-aged children and can help
with housekeeping while the child is in school.

We are looking for candidates who can provide a combination of childcare
and household management support, including help with laundry, cooking.

We are open to discussing both live-in and live-out arrangements for the
right candidate and are hoping to find someone interested in a long-term
position.

Please let me know what information you need from us and whether you have
candidates who may be a good fit.

Thank you, and I look forward to hearing from you.

Best regards,
Bijal Tulsidas

